    "relatedTitle": "Distinguishing the Processing Technologies",
    "relatedText": "This module focuses on advanced finishing, printing and embroidery on products/materials, together with performance and appearance controls. Fabric pretreatment, dyeing and wet-processing finishing are covered in Phase 5 – Dyeing, Printing and Fabric Finishing; Phase 6 – Garment Construction and Assembly; and Phase 15 – Textile Testing and Laboratory. Select the module that matches the actual operation: fabric preparation, product decoration/finishing or test-based validation.",
